6436888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "OPUS: Prism Peak is a narrative adventure where you play as a weary photographer stranded in the Dusklands, traveling with a girl who's lost her memories. Together, you'll uncover the mysteries of this land through your camera and find your way home.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“For adults, the more we shy away from these truths, the more we find ourselves scarred by their relentless grip.”<br>3DM<br><br>“We step directly into Eugene’s shoes, as lost and disoriented as he is, and slowly make our way through the haze of clouded memories and confront the pains of the past. It’s all poetic, really.”<br>Game8<br><br>“At times haunting yet hopeful, it reflects life and reminds us how we grow from experience.”<br>RPGFan<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947910/582757238952893925e0fd0f99167e92cd69805b/header.jpg?t=1786436888", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947910/9968e9a036b0b4223e181685ca407f9e2bac8ea7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786436888", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947910/9968e9a036b0b4223e181685ca407f9e2bac8ea7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786436888", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400｜AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (3GB)｜AMD Radeon RX 570 (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available spa